    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our company's can propose a solution that meets many of the requirements, the specific details of the implementation timeline would depend on further discussions and agreements with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval's regarding project scope, milestones, and resource allocation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, based on our company's company context, our company's are well-positioned to deliver a solution that addresses the client's needs within a reasonable timeframe." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should integrate with existing practices of staff, surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, and suggest actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A), ensure data sovereignty, and comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, and technical constraints as of 2024, can our design an architecture that meets these technical requirements? our can design an architecture to meet these technical requirements using our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform is model-agnostic and can support various models, including sovereign European open-weight models hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which ensures data sovereignty and compliance with GDPR.  our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has components such as document ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer that can be leveraged to provide intelligent assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For medical coding support (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A), our would need to integrate medical coding support (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A) into our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform API-first design allows our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform to be embedded in existing work environments, making our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform accessible from the hospital staff's work environment. our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can also provide explainability and traceability of our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform outputs, which is essential for compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common queries have a p95 latency below 2 seconds, which should be compatible with daily clinical use. our also support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), which would facilitate integration with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure data sovereignty, our can host the solution on OuraneCloud SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring that all data is stored within the European Union and protected by encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our current technology stack, performance benchmarks, sovereign hosting options, and technical constraints as of 2025, our can design an architecture that meets these technical requirements using our Atelier platform, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, ensure the protection of sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant, and comply with regulatory requirements such as personal and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should also hold French H-Bergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification and be hosted on infrastructure that complies with SecNumCloud or equivalent standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks as of 2024, can our company's ensure that our company's proposed solution meets these security and compliance requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's has ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers Development, delivery, and operations, indicating a strong foundation for information security management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's holds ISO 27701 certification, an extension for privacy information management, demonstrating our company's ability to manage personal data in compliance with GDPR and other privacy regulations. our company's also has HDS certification through our company's hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, indicating that its hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified meets specific security standards for hosting health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's processing on its hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified is covered, ensuring the protection of sensitive health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of GDPR compliance, our company's has experience delivering solutions to public-sector and health clients, including those involving special-category (Art. 9) health data, demonstrating our company's familiarity with strict GDPR requirements. our company's also uses encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), pseudonymisation, data minimization, and configurable retention, which are all essential for protecting sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The presence of a Data Protection Officer (DPO), a data processing register, and a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) aligned with GDPR Art. 28 further supports our company's commitment to GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these certifications, instruments, and experiences as of the reference year 2025, our company's is well-positioned to ensure our company's proposed solution meets the specified security and compliance requirements, including strict GDPR compliance, protection of sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation, regulatory requirements for personal and health data protection, holding French H-Bergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and being hosted on compliant infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract covers the design, implementation, and deployment of an artificial intelligence solution for hospital staff. an artificial intelligence solution for hospital staff must comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR, personal and health data protection, and medical confidentiality. an artificial intelligence solution for hospital staff should also ensure that decision-making is not automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, can our company's identify any potential legal risks or liabilities associated with this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for our company's, I have assessed the contract requirements against our company's context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the information available up to the reference year 2025, our company's have experience with French public procurement and compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR, which is essential for handling personal and health data in EU. our company's platform IP model, where the Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by our company's and licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model, should be compatible with this project needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, potential legal risks or liabilities to consider include ensuring that our company's solution does not automate decision-making without explicit validation by a qualified professional, as automate could lead to regulatory non-compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while our company's have professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim, our company's need to ensure that professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim is sufficient for this project specific risks. our company's experience with standard public clauses (CCAG-TIC) and framework agreements could be beneficial in navigating the contractual aspects of this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, it is crucial to carefully review the contract terms to identify any potential liabilities or risks associated with data protection, medical confidentiality, and compliance with relevant EU regulations, including the AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's is registered in France and has experience working within the French legal framework, our company's should be well-positioned to handle the regulatory requirements of this project." ;
